---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  locale="en" 
  customTitle="About Us — EpoxyResin-Calculator.com"
  customDescription="Learn about EpoxyResin-Calculator.com, our mission to provide precision volume modeling, mixing ratio calculations, and workshop safety for makers worldwide."
  showLanguageSelector={false}
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-[#f8fafc] dark:bg-slate-950 transition-colors duration-200">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      {/* Header Breadcrumb */}
      <div class="mb-10 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-8">
        <div>
          <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400 hover:text-cyan-800 dark:hover:text-cyan-300 mb-4 transition-colors">
            ← Back to Calculator
          </a>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl font-black tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl">
          About EpoxyResin<span class="text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400">-Calculator</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          We built EpoxyResin-Calculator.com to eliminate the guesswork, wasted chemical batches, and dangerous thermal runaway in resin woodworking, art casting, and composite fabrication.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Highlights Grid */}
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mb-12">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-5 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400">100%</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mt-1">Client-Side Privacy</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Zero tracking, zero cookies</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-5 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400">5</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mt-1">Geometric Mold Profiles</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Slabs, cylinders, ovals & more</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-5 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400">Vol & Wt</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mt-1">Dual Ratio Engines</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Density-adjusted split math</div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-5 shadow-xs text-center">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400">10</div>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mt-1">Global Languages</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Metric & Imperial native</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* Main Narrative Content */}
      <div class="space-y-10 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        
        {/* Section: The Story */}
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-50 dark:bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 border border-transparent dark:border-cyan-800/60 text-sm font-bold">01</span>
            Why We Created This Tool
          </h2>
          <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-4 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <p>
              Epoxy resin is one of the most versatile and stunning materials in modern craftsmanship—used in live-edge river tables, deep casting molds, high-gloss bar tops, carbon fiber lamination, and jewelry art. Yet, it is also notoriously unforgiving.
            </p>
            <p>
              Under-measuring volume means scrambling to mix another batch mid-cure, resulting in visible seam lines, bubbles, and compromised bond integrity. Over-measuring wastes hundreds of dollars in high-grade polymers that flash-cure in the bucket. Worst of all, confusing volume ratios (like 2:1) with weight ratios without compensating for differing component densities causes tacky, un-cured projects or severe exothermic overheating.
            </p>
            <p>
              We founded <strong>EpoxyResin-Calculator.com</strong> as an independent engineering resource to give craftsmen, makers, and DIYers an accurate, accessible mathematical modeling engine that operates right in their workshop on any phone, tablet, or desktop.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section: Engineering Principles */}
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-50 dark:bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 border border-transparent dark:border-cyan-800/60 text-sm font-bold">02</span>
            Our Core Workshop Principles
          </h2>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5Z"/>
                  <path d="M6 6h10"/>
                  <path d="M6 10h10"/>
                </svg>
                Mathematical Precision
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                We implement true volumetric integration across rectangular river cavities, cylindrical pours, elliptical dishes, and rounded silicone molds, backed by customizable wastage margins (0% to 20%) to account for mixing cup loss and wood grain capillary absorption.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="m12 14 4-4"/>
                  <path d="m3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"/>
                </svg>
                Density-Aware Weight Splits
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Resin Part A and Hardener Part B rarely share identical densities. Our engine computes exact gram and ounce splits using manufacturer specific gravities, so you can weigh on digital scales with complete confidence.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-amber-500 dark:text-amber-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/>
                  <line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/>
                </svg>
                Thermal Safety & Exotherm Warnings
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Epoxy cross-linking generates exothermic heat. Our interface features built-in safety guidance on maximum recommended single-pour depths, layer stratification, and ambient temperature management to protect your workshop.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-800/60 border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                <svg class="h-4 w-4 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                  <rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                  <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
                </svg>
                Zero-Data Privacy Commitment
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Your workshop recipes and project dimensions are your intellectual property. 100% of calculations execute locally in your browser memory. We do not track, log, or store your measurements anywhere.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        {/* Section: Who We Support */}
        <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-slate-800 bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-xs">
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-cyan-50 dark:bg-cyan-950/80 text-cyan-700 dark:text-cyan-300 border border-transparent dark:border-cyan-800/60 text-sm font-bold">03</span>
            Universal Chemical Formulation Support
          </h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our calculator is built to be brand-agnostic and universally compatible with all commercial and craft chemical systems, including:
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 mb-6">
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">1:1 Volume (Bar Top & Coating)</span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">2:1 Volume (Deep Cast & River Tables)</span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">3:1 Volume (High Clarity Casting)</span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">4:1 & 5:1 Volume (Marine & Laminating)</span>
            <span class="rounded-lg bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800 px-3 py-1.5 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">100:X Technical Weight Systems</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Compatible with TotalBoat, EcoPoxy, SuperClear, West System, Craft Resin, Liquid Glass, MAS Epoxies, and custom industrial formulations.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
